                                                "sense_id": "258468c2-220f-3ee6-8f9b-77e83e8b60f4",
                                                "text": "If there be near me now a man of the Achaians who dwelleth far up the Ionian sea, he shall not upbraid me: I have faith in my proxeny […]"
